{"firma": "3e36076cfb7949a6caa0fe54034b48ab8c8ecf3d", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 14979, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "熱風が吹き抜けた！", "jp_grezzo": "\"熱風が吹き抜けた！\"", "en": "It's hot!", "en_grezzo": "\"It's hot!\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Una folata rovente ha spazzato tutto!"}
