{"firma": "6ce3d00dcb3a890eb5815ff7d7cb2684b437473d", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 15263, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "伝令「パルミア軍の撤退が完了しました！これ以上ここに留まる必要はありません。機を見て地下から退却してください！」", "jp_grezzo": "\"伝令「パルミア軍の撤退が完了しました！これ以上ここに留まる必要はありません。機を見て地下から退却してください！」\"", "en": "The messenger says: \\\"The retreat of our army is over now. You don't need to fight them any more. Please leave at once!\\\"", "en_grezzo": "\"The messenger says: \\\"The retreat of our army is over now. You don't need to fight them any more. Please leave at once!\\\"\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Il messaggero: \\\"La ritirata del nostro esercito è completa! Non serve più combatterli. Andatevene subito!\\\""}
{"firma": "0e0b23acdc074e7fd12cd6ee57c7b0c4fa5c196a", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 15265, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "階段が現れた。", "jp_grezzo": "\"階段が現れた。\"", "en": "Suddenly, stairs appear.", "en_grezzo": "\"Suddenly, stairs appear.\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Sono comparse delle scale."}
{"firma": "bac5f38550b94f6b729118fc5e91c43920a55d70", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 15341, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "あなたは罪を悔いた。", "jp_grezzo": "\"あなたは罪を悔いた。\"", "en": "You repent of your sin.", "en_grezzo": "\"You repent of your sin.\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Hai espiato le tue colpe."}
{"firma": "d816b535d5220e86badc82af7b8a0a4bb722e183", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 15353, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "あなたはガードの足音が近づいてくるのに気付いた。", "jp_grezzo": "\"あなたはガードの足音が近づいてくるのに気付いた。\"", "en": "You hear footsteps coming towards your cell.", "en_grezzo": "\"You hear footsteps coming towards your cell.\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Senti i passi di una guardia avvicinarsi alla cella."}
{"firma": "9e035c987c16d710956692ea0af26985e7397d0f", "file": "map.hsp", "riga": 15354, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「そこのお前、出てもいいぞ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「そこのお前、出てもいいぞ」\"", "en": "Hey punk, our boss says you can leave the jail now. Do not come back, okay?", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Hey punk, our boss says you can leave the jail now. Do not come back, okay?\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Ehi, tu. Il capo dice che puoi uscire. Non tornare, chiaro?"}
